  MANUAL unit 6 [minor] split / sā: w "sā" is the feminine nominative form but is labelled m. nom. sg. "he". If sa+asmā is meant, w should be saḥ (as elsewhere); if feminine, the gloss is wrong. Needs a decision.
         suggested fix: w saḥ, or gloss "she"
